\underline{Conjecture} 2.30. \underline{Every reduced proper curve has a
smooth deformation.}

This conjecture implies, by 2.27 and 2.28, that the formal versal scheme of
deformations of $A_s$ is always equidimensional, of dimension
$3\delta(s)-m_1(s)$.



