5.2.11), that if $K\in\operatorname{Ob}D(X_\eta,\Lambda)$ has finite
Tor-dimension at most $d$, where $d\in\mathbb Z$ (SGA~4, XVII, 4.1.9),
then $R\Psi_\eta(K)$ likewise has Tor-dimension at most $d$.


