\begin{equation}\tag{1.2.4}
z(x)=\mathrm{pr}_{2*}\bigl(z\wedge\mathrm{pr}_1^*(x)\bigr),
\end{equation}
where $\mathrm{pr}_{2*}$ is the Gysin homomorphism.  By \`etale localization
