}{\subsubsection*{Proposition 1.5.3.}
Suppose that $f$ and $g$ are proper, that $S$ is connected, and let
$q\in\mathbb Z$.  If the class $z_{\bar\eta}$ induces the zero
homomorphism
\begin{equation}\tag{1.5.3}
