type over $\mathbb F_q$, and let $\underline G$ be a constructible
$T$-integral $E$-sheaf on $X$.  If $\dim X\leq N$, then the $E$-sheaves
$R^if_*\underline G$ on $Y$ are $T$-integral.

\SGAvar{\medskip
