$e$ be the absolute ramification index, and choose an integer
$b>e/(\ell-1)$.  Since $X$ is smooth, hence normal, and its fundamental
group is profinite, there is a twisted-constant $R$-sheaf
$\underline G^\circ$ such that
\[
