Let $X$ be proper over $\Spec(\mathbb F_q)$. There is a canonical
isomorphism

\begin{equation}\tag{2.2.6}
H^i(X,\mathcal O_X)_{\mathrm{ss}}\otimes_{\mathbb F_q}k
\simeq
H^i_{\mathrm{et}}(\bar X,\mathbb Z/p\mathbb Z)
\otimes_{\mathbb F_p}k
\end{equation}

